Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:43.275 --> 00:01:44.548
Home cooking!

19
00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:51.443
Did you know? Swapping a sugary drink for water is one of the easiest healthy changes!

20
00:01:51.493 --> 00:01:53.542
